{
    "background_story": "Cuddly was a gentle giant, a panda bear living in the misty mountains of China. Her home was surrounded by vast fields of Saussurea, a type of flowering plant that bloomed with delicate purple petals. Cuddly loved nothing more than to spend her days lounging in the Saussurea fields, munching on the sweet flowers and watching the clouds drift lazily by. As the seasons changed, Cuddly would help spread the seeds of the Saussurea, ensuring the plants continued to thrive. The locals adored Cuddly, not just for her adorable nature, but also for her role in preserving the delicate ecosystem of the Saussurea fields. As the years passed, Cuddly became a symbol of the region, a reminder of the beauty and importance of preserving the natural world.",
